	<section_number>46.2-341.18:2</section_number>
	<catch_line>Disqualification for use of urine-masking agent or device</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Commissioner shall disqualify for a period of one year any person who has been convicted of a violation of § 18.2-251.4.
